# The pinned tree's copy of the file the oracle repairs, recorded here so the digest is available
# from the pinned commit alone, without an image build.
#
# METRICS-ONLY AS A PER-FILE CHECK. The reward gate this task actually uses is the TREE diff against
# the freshly staged pristine copy (verify_regression_real.py::_edited_paths), because a sealed
# per-file sha256 silently becomes a second correctness gate: a functionally correct repair made
# anywhere else in the engine would score 0, and this task's instruction does not name the file.
# This digest is recorded rather than relied on.
